>> title: Autumn Pumpkin and Lentil Stew
>> servings: 4
>> tags: main, vegan, stew
>> time: 45 minutes

Soften @onion{1}, @carrot{2} and @celery{2%sticks}, all diced, in @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #casserole{} for ~{8%minutes}.

Stir in @garlic{3%cloves}, @cumin{1%tsp} and @smoked paprika{1%tsp} and cook for a minute.

Add @pumpkin{700%g} in cubes, @green lentils{200%g}, @tinned tomatoes{400%g} and @vegetable stock{800%ml}.

Simmer for ~{30%minutes} until the lentils are soft, then finish with @parsley{2%tbsp} and @lemon{1} juice.
